      "resistances": [],
      "stealth": {
        "details": "<p>For APL 13, set the AC to 31 and reduce the saves by 2.</p><p>For APL 15, set the AC to 34, increase the saves by 1, and increase the Hardness <em>to</em> 25.</p><p>Make sure to use the dropdown above to adjust the rest of the sheet.</p>",
        "value": -10
      }
    },
    "details": {
      "description": "<p>A pool is filled with liquid <strong>adamantine</strong> agitated by the Maw's influence, with a control panel next to it. It doesn't hinder movement.</p><p>This pool is <strong>not</strong> automatically destroyed by effects such as <em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.r7ihOgKv19eJQnik]{Disintegrate}</em> and is instead affected as if it was a creature.</p><hr /><p>While adjacent to this pool, players gain the @UUID[Compendium.covalon.fey-courts-items.Item.tBc6dWmVXcJUjX8p]{Sky Coating} action, even if it's disabled or destroyed.</p><hr /><p>A creature other than Lethallica that enters the pool takes @Damage[(3d12+15)[bludgeoning]] and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.D5mg6Tc7Jzrj6ro7]{Encumbered} for 1 round.</p><p>Once fully disabled or destroyed this pool can be traversed safely, and it can't be used for Lethallica's Metalligrasp.</p>",
      "disable": "<p>Arcana, Crafting, Nature, Thievery or <em>dispel magic</em>. A total of two successes are required to disable it. <br>A thieves's toolkit is required for Thievery, and either a thieves's toolkit or a repair toolkit is required for Crafting.<br>@Check[arcana|dc:31|traits:action:disable-a-device] @Check[nature|dc:31|traits:action:disable-a-device] @Check[thievery|dc:32|traits:action:disable-a-device] @Check[crafting|dc:33|traits:action:disable-a-device]</p><p>The counteract DC for <em>dispel magic </em>is <strong>#DC#</strong> and the Pool's counteract rank is <strong>APL/2 rounded up</strong>. A successful counteract counts as one successful disable, unless the counteract check was a critical success in which case it fully disables the Pool.</p>",
      "isComplex": true,
      "level": {
        "value": 14
      },
      "publication": {
        "authors": "",
        "license": "ORC",
        "remaster": false,
        "title": ""
      },
      "reset": "",
      "routine": "<p>(1 action) The pool produces the effects of a 10th-rank <em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.CB5TlGv5ZghtMifi]{Wall of Metal} </em>spell, except the wall can only be up to 30 feet long and lasts 1 round.</p><p>This wall doesn't block line of effect for Lethallica's Corrosion of the Metal Plane ability.</p>"
    },
